BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  # The Tale of the Twin Springs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. Each possessed a magical sp) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    ring-one in the East, one in the West.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  The Eastern spring held a curious enchantment: any water poured from it would triple in volume) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (     when it reached the Western village. The Western spring had the power to return water back ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    across the valley, but only if given freely.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  For generations, the villages hoarded their waters, fearing the other would take without givin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    g back. The valley remained dry, and both suffered from scarcity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  One season, a brave Eastern elder decided to trust. She poured half her spring's water toward ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    the West. The water tripled as it flowed, creating a rushing stream that filled the Western ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    wells abundantly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  Moved by this generosity, the Western village returned even more than the elder had originally) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (     sent. The water flowed back enriched with minerals from their soil.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  Understanding bloomed between the villages. They began exchanging water freely-each sending po) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    rtions, watching them multiply, and returning shares with gratitude. The valley transformed ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    into a fertile garden.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  The springs taught them: **generosity multiplies blessings, but only trust and reciprocity unl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (    ock abundance for all.**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (  When both give freely and return fairly, everyone prospers beyond what either could achieve al) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    one.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (Reasoning:) Tj ET
