BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a barren valley. Each had little) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (         water, barely enough to survive. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      One day, a stranger appeared to the first village with a clay vessel. "Pour your water her) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (        e," she said, "and it will flow to your neighbors threefold. But only if you trust them ) Tj ET
