BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      The villagers were afraid. If they sent their precious water and received nothing in retur) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        n, they would perish. But the elders decided: "We must have faith. Abundance cannot grow) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (         from closed hands.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
