BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    The First Weaver spoke: "Nine cycles have taught us that perfection compounds. Each successf) Tj ET
